        site, a third-party app store, or any other distribution channel — without
        prior written permission from the copyright holder.
   2.2  You may NOT rebrand, whitewash, or present the Software or a derivative of
        it as your own original work, including changing the app name, package
        name/applicationId, or icon and re-releasing it.
   2.3  You may NOT remove or alter this license, the copyright notice, or any
        attribution present in the Software when redistributing source code
        copies (source-code sharing for contribution/education purposes under
        Section 1 is fine; shipping a compiled app to end users is not).
   2.4  You may NOT use the Software, in whole or in part, as a component of a
        commercial product or service without prior written permission.

